[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 6722.31, "timestamp": "01:52:02", "text": "那边现在都凌晨三点了。 但是，到了早上 6 点"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6724.149, "timestamp": "01:52:04", "text": "或者清晨的时候，你就会看到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6726.39, "timestamp": "01:52:06", "text": "不同的景象。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6729.109, "timestamp": "01:52:09", "text": "我从中获得了极大的启发。 我当时"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6731.35, "timestamp": "01:52:11", "text": "想，我想学怎么做，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6734.39, "timestamp": "01:52:14", "text": "但我不会编程。 所以我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6738.229, "timestamp": "01:52:18", "text": "调查了一下TJP。 我告诉他们我想要什么，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6742.629, "timestamp": "01:52:22", "text": "呃等等。 所以我必须把"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6747.75, "timestamp": "01:52:27", "text": "所有这些东西都放在一个HTML嵌入代码里。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6750.79, "timestamp": "01:52:30", "text": "确实很不错。 这样一来，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6753.91, "timestamp": "01:52:33", "text": "我就不需要再像以前那样设置浅色"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6757.03, "timestamp": "01:52:37", "text": "模式和深色模式的切换开关了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6759.589, "timestamp": "01:52:39", "text": "我可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6763.51, "timestamp": "01:52:43", "text": "运行一段代码，让它检测"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6767.51, "timestamp": "01:52:47", "text": "天气状况、时区等"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6769.669, "timestamp": "01:52:49", "text": "信息，或者将来可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6773.91, "timestamp": "01:52:53", "text": "根据用户的时间自动切换模式。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6779.27, "timestamp": "01:52:59", "text": "对，这就是我的想法。"}]